i>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-5265 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/aace5df3-300x234.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"234\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/aace5df3-300x234.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/aace5df3-1024x797.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/aace5df3-768x598.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/aace5df3.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>Rychl\u00e1 a efektivn\u00ed anal\u00fdza je v\u00a0ml\u00e9k\u00e1rensk\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e1 z\u00a0\u0159ady d\u016fvod\u016f. Pomoc\u00ed dob\u0159e zvolen\u00e9 metody m\u016f\u017eete u\u0161et\u0159it \u010das a materi\u00e1l, a v\u00fdznamn\u011b tak zjednodu\u0161it anal\u00fdzu. Nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 data a u\u0161et\u0159en\u00e9 prost\u0159edky pak m\u016f\u017eete vyu\u017e\u00edt k\u00a0optimalizaci procesu v\u00fdroby a zlep\u0161en\u00ed kvality v\u00fdrobk\u016f. FT-NIR spektrometry lze vyu\u017e\u00edt ke zkvalitn\u011bn\u00ed kontroly v\u00fdrobn\u00edho procesu, k\u00a0verifikaci vstupn\u00edch surovin meziprodukt\u016f a hotov\u00fdch v\u00fdrobk\u016f i v\u00fdvoji dal\u0161\u00edch technologi\u00ed.<\/p><p>S jedn\u00edm jedin\u00fdm p\u0159\u00edstrojem je mo\u017en\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159it kapaln\u00e9, pr\u00e1\u0161kovit\u00e9 i pastovit\u00e9 vzorky: ml\u00e9ko, smetanu, podm\u00e1sl\u00ed i syrov\u00e1tku, m\u00e1slo, s\u00fdry v\u0161ech druh\u016f, tvarohy a tvarohov\u00e9 kr\u00e9my, jogurty, dezerty, zmrzliny i ml\u00e9\u010dn\u00e9 n\u00e1poje, su\u0161en\u00e9 ml\u00e9ko, syrov\u00e1tkov\u00fd protein a dal\u0161\u00ed, a to b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika vte\u0159in.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_1896\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1896\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1896 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9bea2264-300x260.jpg\" alt=\"FT-NIR spektrometr Antaris II\" width=\"300\" height=\"260\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9bea2264-300x260.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9bea2264.jpg 468w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1896\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-NIR spektrometr Antaris II<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>Program TQ Analyst nab\u00edz\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u016fm mo\u017enost vytv\u00e1\u0159et kalibra\u010dn\u00ed metody, pomoc\u00ed nich\u017e je mo\u017en\u00e9 stanovit \u0159adu parametr\u016f m\u011b\u0159en\u00e9ho materi\u00e1lu. Tyto metody lze roz\u0161i\u0159ovat a upravovat tak, aby co nejl\u00e9pe popisovaly m\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 vzorky. Program vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 pokro\u010dil\u00e9 matematick\u00e9 algoritmy a umo\u017e\u0148uje nejen kvantifikaci analyt\u016f ve vzorku, ale tak\u00e9 klasifikaci jednotliv\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f.<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ft-nir-spektroskopie-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ft-nir-spektroskopie-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5035 .elementor-element.elementor-element-34f94d76 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5035 .elementor-element.elementor-element-34f94d76 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5035\" class=\"elementor elementor-5035\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-sect